---
title: "Known bug: a delete races a switch of the active Game"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant You as You
  participant P as Active Game pointer
  participant G as Busy registry
  You->>P: delete Game 2: is it the active Game?
  P-->>You: no, Game 1 is active
  You->>P: switch to Game 2
  Note over P: the active Game is Game 2
  You->>G: delete the rows of Game 2
  Note over G,P: Game 2 is gone, and it is the active Game
  Note over G,P: rule DeleteNotActive breaks here
